This section contains step-by-step guides for common terminal payment tasks.
Currently you can learn how to pair a Solo reader with a merchant account and
initiate payments using the Cloud API.

- **[Pairing a Solo reader](/docs/terminal-payments/guides/pairing-solo/)** –
  enroll the device and link it to an account so it can process transactions.
